                  <h2 class="program-cards__title">
            Programs  &amp; Possibilities
          </h2>
                          <div class="program-cards__description">
            Western programs are developed with one goal in mind: preparing you for work. Our education aligns with local and regional job opportunities, so you graduate ready to step into a career. <br />
<br />
Check out these highlighted programs.
          </div>
